  "fields": {
    "name": "ShardSetBatch fluent step-addition family",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "text",
    "contract": "ShardSetBatch builds a no-result Batch by accepting exactly one of three step forms: an existing BatchStep<object>; a Query with no explicit parameter collection; or a Query paired with its DbParameterCollection. Each Add call returns the same ShardSetBatch instance so callers can chain additions; the accepted steps remain in their addition order for the batch's later shard execution."
  },
